        "text_VNTWFH": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The unique DNA of the House lies in its ability to draw from iconic artistic movements across history, literature and cinema to craft a distinctive design story for each piece. To faithfully achieve this, each collection is preceded by rich heritage immersion: poring over historical archives, engaging with academic scholarship, and experimenting with diverse materials and treatments.<br/><br/>Each creation is then handcrafted using solid 14k gold and carbon-neutral lab grown diamonds in our esteemed partner atelier in Valenza, Italy––the global cradle of high jewelry, working side by side with our master craftsmen. We always produce in extremely limited editions, often no more than 250 of the same style, to preserve the standing of each RUDIN creation as a unique cultural icon.<br/></p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
