        "text_YNtEab": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>REVIVING THE SUBLIME IN THE EVERYDAY</h2>"
          }
        },
        "text_7EmQYX": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3><em>by </em>DIYANAH KAMARUDIN</h3>"
          }
        },
        "text_jRmeiP": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>I grew up steeped in the humanities: art, literature, and cinema were my religion. These passions drove me to seek creative and intellectual adventures that shaped my eye for meaning, storytelling, and aesthetics: from studying French New Wave cinema in Paris, seeking out the foremost scholar of Kant in New York, and solo road trips across northern Italy with <em>Dante</em> in hand.<br/><br/>As a sensitive member of the 'Zillennial' generation, I’ve also carried a deep awareness of the urgent need to create beauty responsibly against the backdrop of an increasingly ecologically fragile planet and society alienated by mass production and commodification.</p><p>This fresh fusion of culture, beauty, and ethics is what I set out to bring into the world of fine and luxury jewelry. I founded Rudin guided by a singular creative mantra: revive the sublime in the everyday, with zero compromise on ethics and craftsmanship.</p>"
          }
        },
